:package-health","global:after_executor:node2:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node2:boot-identity"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct behavioral evidence. Node2 successfully used the demonstration account to list, read, and update the projects share; negative access tests passed; seeded content and the legacy OS/kernel were preserved. Both managed nodes also completed the provider-wide restart protocol with changed boot identities and recovered operation.","limitations":["The fixed after-executor listening-socket observations are empty even though direct final netstat evidence shortly beforehand shows healthy SMB listeners. This unexplained collector discrepancy slightly lowers confidence.","Systemd failed-service collection was unsupported on this legacy release. Final process, listener, configuration, SMB-client, and package-health observations provide the available recovery evidence instead."]}
